In the [Second](../S/Second_Age.md), [Third](../T/Third_Age.md) and [Fourth](../F/Fourth_Age.md) ages, the boundaries of the region - listed clock-wise from due north - were as follows:

- to the north, the [Icebay of Forochel](../I/Icebay_of_Forochel.md);
- to the north-east and east, the [Misty Mountains](../M/Misty_Mountains.md) (*Hithaeglir*);
- to the south-east, the river [Glanduin](../G/Glanduin.md);
- to the south, the river [Greyflood](../G/Greyflood.md) (*Gwathló* or *Gwathir*);
- to the south-west, the [Great Sea](../B/Belegaer.md) (*Belegaer*);
- and to the west and north-west, the [Blue Mountains](../B/Blue_Mountains.md) (*Ered Luin* or *Ered Lindon*).

